sentences.l:
The gentleman, not for one meal's span, departs from humaneness;
in haste and hurry, surely he is in it;
in toppling and overthrow, surely he is in it.”

The Master said: “Do not fret at having no post;
fret over what you would stand in it by.
Do not fret that no one knows you;
seek to be such as can be known.”

The Master said: “In serving father and mother, remonstrate gently;
seeing their will does not go along,
be reverent again, and do not go against them;
toiling, yet do not resent.”
